<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105987" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῡρ-εύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρόω</span>
			, <i>make cheese, make into cheese,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Com.Adesp.
				1173
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρεύεται τὸ γάλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					522b2
				</span></i>
			: impers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρεύεται</span>
			<i>cheese is made,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				521b30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.
			(cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυρόω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.2
				</span></i>
			), <i>mix up cunningly, contrive by trickery and intrigue,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόν τινι τ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Asin.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				136.6J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Adam.
				1.3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>: abs., <i>concoct mischief,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.295
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐπί τινι τυρευθεῖσα ἐπιβουλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.66
				</span></i>
			.</div>
